<title>UK: Paragon buying SocGen UK mortgage portfolio.</title>
<headline>Paragon buying SocGen UK mortgage portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paragon Group Of Companies Plc said on Thursday that it is buying the UK mortgage portfolio of French bank Societe Generale for around 36 million stg in cash.</p>
</text>
